# 🧠 Resume Screening App

An intelligent **Resume Screening System** built using **Natural Language Processing (NLP)** and **Machine Learning**.  
The app helps HR professionals and recruiters **automatically analyze and classify resumes** to identify the most suitable candidates based on their skills, experience, and job category.

