## 🧩 Overview
The **Resume Screening App** allows users to upload a resume (in PDF format).  
It processes the text using NLP techniques (tokenization, cleaning, vectorization) and then predicts the **job domain** (e.g., Data Science, Web Development, Network Security, Health & Fitness, etc.) using a trained machine learning model.

The app is deployed using **Streamlit**, providing a simple and interactive web interface.

---

## ✨ Features
✅ Upload resumes in PDF or TXT format.  
✅ Automatically extract and clean text from the resume.  
✅ Predict the most suitable job category using a trained model.  
✅ Display predictions in a clear, user-friendly Streamlit interface.  

---

## 🧠 Tech Stack
| Category | Tools |
|-----------|-------|
| Language | Python 3.8 |
| Framework | Streamlit |
| NLP Libraries | NLTK, scikit-learn |
| Data Handling | Pandas, NumPy |
| Model Storage | Pickle |
| Visualization | Matplotlib / Seaborn (optional) |

